<<if $f2door >= true>>
<<link [[Go in the boss room|F2 BOSS]]>>
<<dateadd '10m'>>
<</link>>
<<elseif $f2door <= false or !$f2door>>
You touch the door, it glows in light blue but it does not open.
<</if>>
<</nobr>>
<<link [[Sit down|FD2.6]]>>
<<dateadd '10m'>>
<<Resting>>
<</link>>

